            "subject": "Welcome to the team, {{369490443__COL$A}}!",
            "body": "{{369490444__welcome_email}}<br/><br/>We're excited to have you join our team as a {{369490443__COL$C}} in {{369490443__COL$D}}. Your manager, {{369490443__COL$F}}, will be reaching out shortly with your first-week agenda and key action items to get you up to speed.<br/><br/>If you have any questions or need anything before your start date on {{369490443__COL$E}}, please don't hesitate to reach out.<br/><br/>Regards,<br/>Mark"
